  "title": "Macadamia Nut Crusted Mahi Mahi",
  "description": "Mahi mahi is coated in macadamia nuts and breadcrumbs and lightly fried, then baked, and served with a sauce featuring tropical fruit, hot pepper, shallots, and chicken stock.",
  "authors": [
    "Chef David Highlander"
  ],
